dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.npc = Twiggy
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.role = gardener
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.accueil = Oh! A seed walking on two legs! Welcome under our leaves, traveller.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.accueil.qui = Who are you?
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.tableau = Show me the village board.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aurevoir = Goodbye.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.presentation = Twiggy, at your service! I sing for the sprouts, and the sprouts sing for me.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aider = Can I help the village?
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aplustard = See you later.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aide = The village hungers for seeds. Three carrot seeds, and the grove will be grateful!
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aide.donner = Here are three seeds.
