dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.reviendrai = I will come back.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.merci = Your seeds are singing already! Here, some apples for the road.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.merci.cadeau = Thank you, Twiggy.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.merci.cadeau.hint = receive 2 apples
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.merci.cadeau.fail = you already got your gift
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.retour = There you are again, wandering seed! The wind brought you back.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.nouvelles = How is the village?
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.nouvelles.fail = the village must be at least a hamlet
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.nouvelles.message = Twiggy hums: the hamlet's roofs grow like mushrooms after rain.

