dialogue.Kweebec_Crieur.role = Voice of the village
dialogue.Kweebec_Crieur.accueil = Hear ye, hear ye! The village needs helping hands. Today's requests are nailed to the board, right behind me.
dialogue.Kweebec_Crieur.voir = Show me the requests.
dialogue.Kweebec_Crieur.quoi = How does it work?
dialogue.Kweebec_Crieur.explication = Three requests every morning. Take one, fulfil it before the next morning, and the village grows. Items go in the chest on the square, or you can hand them in here.
dialogue.Kweebec_Crieur.encours = So, those requests? Got what we need on you?
dialogue.Kweebec_Crieur.rendre = Here's what I have.
dialogue.Kweebec_Crieur.rendu = Noted, noted. The village will remember.
dialogue.Kweebec_Crieur.aurevoir = See you later.

