dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.npc = Rootsinger
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.role = Village chief
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.aurevoir = May the sap keep you.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.nouvelles = And the Trorks?
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.nouvellesTexte = The wind carries their drums. Keep your eyes open, and your ears too.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.accepter = I'll see to it.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.accepte = Go, and come back whole. The Grandfather is waiting.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.auxArmes = No time for songs! The Trorks are in the grove: defend the Grandfather!
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.honni = Go away. The Grandfather wants none of you here.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.etranger = The Grandfather is fading, stranger. I will not trust his sap to you.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.commentAider = How do I earn your trust?
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.conseil = Help the village: the board's requests. Once we tolerate you, come back to me.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.voirDemandes = See the requests
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.seve = The Grandfather is fading: the Trorks steal his sap and the young sprouts wither. Bring us sap, and we will see if you are a friend.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.donnerSeve = Here are ten drops of sap.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.failSeve = you must be Tolerated by the Kweebecs and carry 10 Sap
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.prisonniers = The sprouts are greening again, thank you. But the Trorks hold one of ours in their camp. When you are our friend, bring them back.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.prisonniersEnCours = The prisoner is waiting somewhere in the Trork camp. Bring them to the village heart.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.bosquet = You brought them back! The little one still sings. The Trorks burned the grove where they played: replant it, six oak sprouts.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.bosquetEnCours = The grove is waiting for its sprouts. Six, no fewer: the Grandfather will count them.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.veille = The grove grows back. The Trorks saw it, they will come. When you are our host, watch over the Grandfather with us during their raid.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.veilleAcceptee = They will come tonight. Stay near the Grandfather, with our guards.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.veilleAttente = The grove grows back, and the Trorks have seen it. But the Grandfather has not taken root here yet: help the village grow into a town, and we will watch over him together.
dialogue.fail.building.Grand_Pere = the Grandfather must have taken root in the village (Town tier)
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.veilleEnCours = Tonight the Trorks will come. Stay near the Grandfather, with our guards.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.graine = You held through the night. The Grandfather sang me a seed for you: an Echo Seed. I will give it only to the champion of our people.
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.recevoirGraine = Receive the Echo Seed
dialogue.Kweebec_Chef.fin = The Echo Seed sings in your pocket. The Feran, they say, will recognise it.

# Étape 7 : camp trork, Peinture de guerre, Klops errant (tools/generate_trorks.py)
